[[village square]]:
{{#if (visits "village square") = 1}}
You arrive in a small village. Its square is busy with market stalls.
{{else}}
You're back in the village square.
{{/if}}

From here you can visit the [[bakery]] or the [[well]], or [[leave the village]](leave).

[[bakery]]:
{{#if (visits "bakery") = 1}}The baker gives you a warm bun.{{else}}The baker waves at you again.{{/if}} [[Back to the square]](village square)

[[well]]:
You look down the well, but it's too dark to see the bottom. [[Back to the square]](village square)

[[leave]]:
@end
You leave the village{{#if (seen "bakery")}}, still eating your bun{{/if}}.
